@startuml "Scan et décodage du QR code"

title Processus de scan et décodage du QR code

actor "Contrôleur\n(Staff événement)" as Controller
participant "App Mobile\n(Scan QR)" as MobileApp
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Ticket Controller" as TicketCtrl
participant "QR Service" as QRSvc
participant "Ticket Service" as TicketSvc
participant "Redis Cache" as Redis
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Scan du QR code ==
Controller -> MobileApp: Scanner QR code
MobileApp -> MobileApp: Lire QR code
MobileApp -> API: POST /api/tickets/validate
note right: Body: {qrCode, eventId, scannedBy: staffId}

API -> Auth: Vérifier token staff
Auth --> API: staff verified

API -> TicketCtrl: validateTicket(qrCode, eventId, staffId)
TicketCtrl -> QRSvc: decodeQRCode(qrCode)
QRSvc -> QRSvc: Parse QR data and verify signature
QRSvc --> TicketCtrl: {ticketId, eventId, userId, timestamp}

== Récupération des données du billet ==
TicketCtrl -> TicketSvc: validateTicketAccess(ticketId, eventId)
TicketSvc -> Redis: GET ticket:{ticketId}:validation_cache
Redis --> TicketSvc: cached validation (if exists)

alt Cache miss ou données expirées
    TicketSvc -> DB: SELECT ticket WITH user, order, event WHERE id=?
    DB --> TicketSvc: complete ticket data
    TicketSvc -> Redis: SET ticket:{ticketId}:validation_cache = data (expire 1h)
end

TicketSvc --> TicketCtrl: ticket data ready for validation

@enduml